0..77 Comment "// The composite of two paths, the HoTT book\'s Lemma 2.1.2 (`p · q`), at the"
78..153 Comment "// integers: `q then r` joins a path to one leaving its endpoint, and a run"
154..229 Comment "// joins reflexivity to itself. `q then r` is the unbiased composite of the"
230..297 Comment "// 2-chain at its least stratum, `compose[3, 5](chain(2), (q, r))`."
299..323 Comment "// Reflexivity at seven."
